{
  "uid": "pa-authentik",
  "title": "Authentik",
  "description": "Authentik, which signs everyone in (R40): whether its server and worker are up, sign-ins that worked and failed (by reason, never who), its requests, flows and worker tasks, its errors and its database connections (R89a, R89b).",
  "tags": ["pagerarchive"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "Authentik has two parts. The **server** answers the sign-in pages and PagerArchive's questions: while it's down, nobody can sign in. The **worker** runs background tasks, such as sending emails (codes, invitations): while it's down, sign-ins work but no email goes out. **Up** is red for either one the stack can't reach (the \"Authentik down\" alert).\n\n**Sign-ins** come from Authentik's event log, counted each minute over the 5 minutes before, so one sign-in shows for 5 minutes. A failed one says only where it failed: the **password**, the **second factor** (Authentik's own admin), or **other**. Never who, or from where. A few failures are people mistyping; a burst is someone guessing (the \"Failed sign-ins\" alert), and the guessing protection locks each account after 5 (R44a). **Errors** are what Authentik recorded as going wrong: its admin interface (Events → Logs) has the detail."}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Up",
      "description": "Whether the stack can scrape Authentik's server and worker (port 9300, over the monitoring-authentik network). DOWN fires \"Authentik down\" after a minute. \"Not watched\" when the stack doesn't scrape Authentik.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "expr": "max by (instance) (up{job=\"authentik\"})", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"noValue": "Not watched", "mappings": [{"type": "value", "options": {"0": {"text": "DOWN", "color": "red"}, "1": {"text": "up", "color": "green"}}}], "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Workers connected",
      "description": "How many worker processes the server sees. 0 while the worker is up means it can't reach the database; the tasks queue up.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "expr": "max(sum by (instance) (authentik_tasks_workers{job=\"authentik\"}))"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not watched", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Signed in, last 5 minutes",
      "description": "Sign-ins that worked in the last 5 minutes, from Authentik's event log (R89b).",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "expr": "sum(pagerarchive_authentik_events_5m{job=\"pagerarchive\", action=\"login\"})"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not counted", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "text", "value": null}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Failed sign-ins, last 5 minutes",
      "description": "Sign-ins that failed in the last 5 minutes, any reason. Orange from 5; red above 10, when \"Failed sign-ins\" fires.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "expr": "sum(pagerarchive_authentik_events_5m{job=\"pagerarchive\", action=\"login_failed\"})"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not counted", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 5}, {"color": "red", "value": 11}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "stat", "title": "Accounts locked",
      "description": "Accounts the guessing protection has locked now (R44a): 5 wrong passwords or codes in 15 minutes lock an account for 15 minutes.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "expr": "max(pagerarchive_accounts_locked{job=\"pagerarchive\"})"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not counted", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Sign-ins (each minute, over the 5 minutes before)",
      "description": "Sign-ins that worked, and failed ones by where they failed: password, second factor, or other (R89b). Counted each minute over the 5 minutes before, so a burst shows as a plateau 5 minutes wide.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "max(pagerarchive_authentik_events_5m{job=\"pagerarchive\", action=\"login\"})", "legendFormat": "signed in"},
        {"refId": "B", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "max by (reason) (pagerarchive_authentik_events_5m{job=\"pagerarchive\", action=\"login_failed\"})", "legendFormat": "failed: {{reason}}"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not counted"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "signed in"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green"}}]}]},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Errors Authentik recorded (each minute, over the 5 minutes before)",
      "description": "From Authentik's event log, by kind (R89b): system_exception (Authentik itself failed), system_task_exception (a worker task failed, such as sending an email), configuration_error, policy_exception and property_mapping_exception (a policy or mapping that throws). Anything above 0 is worth a look in Authentik's admin interface, Events → Logs.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "max by (action) (pagerarchive_authentik_events_5m{job=\"pagerarchive\", action!~\"login|login_failed\"})", "legendFormat": "{{action}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not counted"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Requests per second, by status",
      "description": "Requests Authentik's server answered, by HTTP status: the sign-in pages, PagerArchive's questions (tokens, users, invitations) and the admin interface. 4xx are mostly normal (an expired session); 5xx are Authentik failing.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(django_http_responses_total_by_status_view_method_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{status}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "noValue": "Not watched"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Server errors (5xx) by view (per minute)",
      "description": "Requests that ended with a 5xx status, per minute, by Authentik's view (its name for the page or API endpoint) and status. Empty is good.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (view, status) (rate(django_http_responses_total_by_status_view_method_total{job=\"authentik\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{view}} {{status}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60}, "noValue": "None"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Slowest 10% of requests, by view",
      "description": "The 90th percentile of how long Authentik took to answer, by view, for the views that were used. The flow executor (flows/executor) is the sign-in pages; a password check is meant to be slow (it hashes), about a quarter of a second.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 27},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.9, sum by (le, view) (rate(django_http_requests_latency_seconds_by_view_method_bucket{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval]))) > 0", "legendFormat": "{{view}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "noValue": "Not watched"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Flows started (per minute)",
      "description": "Flows Authentik started, by flow: pagerarchive-authentication is a sign-in, pagerarchive-enrolment a new account from an invitation, pagerarchive-recovery a forgotten password. Starts, not completions: the sign-in panels say how they ended.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 27},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (flow_slug) (rate(authentik_flows_plan_time_count{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{flow_slug}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "None"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Worker tasks (per minute)",
      "description": "Background tasks the worker ran, per minute, and those that failed, were retried, or were given up on (rejected). A task that fails is retried; one rejected is lost, and Authentik's admin interface (System → Tasks) says why.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 35},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(rate(authentik_tasks_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "ran"},
        {"refId": "B", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(rate(authentik_tasks_errors_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "failed"},
        {"refId": "C", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(rate(authentik_tasks_retries_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "retried"},
        {"refId": "D", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(rate(authentik_tasks_rejected_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "rejected"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "Not watched"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "failed"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red"}}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "rejected"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "dark-red"}}]}]},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "table", "title": "Tasks that failed (time range)",
      "description": "The worker's tasks that failed in the dashboard's time range, by task, with how many times. Empty is good. A task's first failure after Authentik starts isn't counted here (the counter starts at it); the errors panel above counts every one.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 35},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "instant": true, "format": "table", "expr": "round(sum by (actor_name) (increase(authentik_tasks_errors_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__range]))) > 0"}],
      "transformations": [{"id": "organize", "options": {"excludeByName": {"Time": true}, "renameByName": {"actor_name": "Task", "Value": "Failures"}}}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"noValue": "None"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"showHeader": true}
    },
    {
      "id": 15, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Tasks waiting",
      "description": "Tasks queued for the worker and not started yet, and those running. A queue that grows and doesn't empty means the worker is down or stuck.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 43},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "max(sum by (instance) (authentik_tasks_queued{job=\"authentik\"}))", "legendFormat": "queued"},
        {"refId": "B", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum(authentik_tasks_in_progress{job=\"authentik\"})", "legendFormat": "running"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "Not watched"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 16, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Database: new connections and errors (per minute)",
      "description": "Connections Authentik's server and worker opened to the database, per minute, and database errors by kind. Authentik keeps its connections, so a steady stream of new ones, or any errors, means the database is restarting or unreachable (docs/deploy.md: Authentik reconnects within about a minute).",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 43},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(django_db_new_connections_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} new connections"},
        {"refId": "B", "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"}, "expr": "sum by (instance, type) (rate(django_db_errors_total{job=\"authentik\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} errors: {{type}}"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "noValue": "Not watched"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    }
  ]
}
